#### 3. Root Cause Exception & Error Span
- **Error Type:** `{error.type / Exception class}`
- **Error Message:** `{error.message}`
- **Failing Span:** `{span_name}`

#### 4. Raw Stack Trace
```
{exact stack trace from Datadog logs}
```

#### 5. Downstream Dependencies
- Downstream call status: `{database / third-party HTTP / message queue status}`
```
